sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.leaves.index)"
    participant Controller as "Employee LeaveController"
    participant Model as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Buka menu Cuti Saya
    View->>Controller: GET /employee/leaves
    Controller->>Model: Build filter (status, jenis, tahun, tanggal)
    Model->>DB: SELECT leave_requests + relasi leave_type/approver
    DB-->>Model: Data cuti pegawai
    Model-->>Controller: Koleksi cuti terfilter

    alt Data valid (data ditemukan)
        Controller->>View: Render tabel, summary, filter
        View-->>Pegawai: Daftar pengajuan cuti tampil
    else Data tidak valid (worker/data tidak ditemukan atau query error)
        Controller->>View: Redirect dashboard/back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal memuat cuti
    end
